# CRM: pipelines, deals (board), tasks and notes.
# A rate request (reply pipeline or `create_pricing_lead`) opens a deal automatically in the
# default "Freight quotes" pipeline; moving it to Won/Lost closes it and its lead.

@token = PASTE-A-PRICING-OR-ADMIN-DEV-TOKEN
@pipelineId = PASTE-A-PIPELINE-ID
@stageId = PASTE-A-STAGE-ID
@dealId = PASTE-A-DEAL-ID
@contactId = PASTE-A-CONTACT-ID

### Pipelines and their stages (the default one is created on first use)
GET {{baseUrl}}/crm/pipelines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A second pipeline (admin): it needs an open, a won and a lost stage
POST {{baseUrl}}/crm/pipelines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pipeline-ocean-contracts-001

{
  "name": "Ocean contracts",
  "stages": [
    {"name": "RFQ received", "kind": "open", "probability": 20},
    {"name": "Tender submitted", "kind": "open", "probability": 50},
    {"name": "Awarded", "kind": "won", "probability": 100},
    {"name": "Not awarded", "kind": "lost"}
  ]
}

### The board: deals of a pipeline in stage and card order
GET {{baseUrl}}/crm/deals?pipeline_id={{pipelineId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A deal by hand
POST {{baseUrl}}/crm/deals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: deal-ist-cargo-001

{
  "contact_id": "{{contactId}}",
  "title": "IST Cargo: YYZ → IST monthly air",
  "value_amount": "4200.00",
  "currency": "USD",
  "service_line": "air",
  "origin": "YYZ CA",
  "destination": "IST TR"
}

### Drop it on a stage (index = position in the column; Won/Lost close it)
POST {{baseUrl}}/crm/deals/{{dealId}}/move
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: deal-move-001

{
  "stage_id": "{{stageId}}",
  "index": 0
}

### Its history: stage changes, value changes, notes, tasks and emails
GET {{baseUrl}}/crm/deals/{{dealId}}/timeline
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My open tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/crm/tasks?mine=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A task on the deal
POST {{baseUrl}}/crm/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: task-call-001

{
  "title": "Send the YYZ → IST rates",
  "deal_id": "{{dealId}}",
  "due_at": "2026-10-01T15:00:00-04:00",
  "priority": "high"
}

### A note
POST {{baseUrl}}/crm/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: note-001

{
  "deal_id": "{{dealId}}",
  "body": "Prefers Turkish Cargo; wants a weekly consolidation price."
}

### Numbers for the dashboard (open value, weighted value, wins, tasks due)
GET {{baseUrl}}/crm/summary?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
